# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Root environment. Copy to `.env.local` (gitignored).
#
# This file used to configure the Next.js web app against cloud Firebase and
# five Cloud Run services. None of that exists any more:
#
#   - the GCP stack (Cloud Run / Cloud Build / GCS / Firestore) was removed
#     2026-07-31; the viewer is now the self-hostable Node process in `viewer/`
#   - the Firebase auth surface was removed 2026-08-08 (its token reached
#     nothing — see tasks/todo.md)
#
# So exactly one variable here is read by anything. If you are looking for
# viewer configuration, it is `viewer/.env.example`, not this file.
# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Anthropic API key for the Editor's chat / LLM edit lane. Server-side only —
# do NOT add a NEXT_PUBLIC_ prefix.
#
# OPTIONAL. The Editor defaults to the user's Claude subscription via the
# bundled `claude` binary and needs no key. Set this only for BYO-key use; the
# Anthropic SDK throws "Could not resolve authentication method" at first
# request if a key-based provider is selected without one. Override the
# variable NAME per-prototype via `apiKeyEnv` in `.desde/config.json`.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
